{"id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-satisfaction-modal.md","title":"Modal Satisfaction","display":"df-satisfaction-modal — Modal Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","aliases":["89-df-satisfaction-modal"],"display":"df-satisfaction-modal — Modal Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-world]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-satisfaction-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-satisfaction-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction-modal — Modal Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-satisfaction-modal-—-Modal-Satisfaction-$\\models$\">df-satisfaction-modal — Modal Satisfaction <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\\)</span> (Kripke model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w \\in W\">\\(w \\in W\\)</span> (world, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{M},w&amp;\\not\\models\\bot,\\\\\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models p\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\neg A\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathcal{M},w\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models(A\\land B)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathcal{M},w\\models A)\\land(\\mathcal{M},w\\models B),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\Box A\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to\\mathcal{M},v\\models A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{M},w&amp;\\not\\models\\bot,\\\\\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models p\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\neg A\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathcal{M},w\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models(A\\land B)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathcal{M},w\\models A)\\land(\\mathcal{M},w\\models B),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\Box A\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to\\mathcal{M},v\\models A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span>的世界<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>中为真</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\psi\">\\(\\Box\\psi\\)</span> : 在所有可达世界中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>为真</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-satisfaction-modal-—-Modal-Satisfaction-$\\models$","text":"df-satisfaction-modal — Modal Satisfaction $\\models$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-world","status":"resolved","id":"edcd1eb132936613","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-world]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)$ (Kripke model, see [[89-df-kripke-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-world","status":"resolved","id":"edcd1eb132936613","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$w \\in W$ (world, see [[89-df-world]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\in